Fun, but trialing ascension...
My second Valk, but my 1st ascension in a long time.
Coaligned altar on 3rd level and about 20th level.  I got a magic lamp
in minetown which yielded +2 GDSM.  Bag of holding in Sokoban.  Dipped
for Excaliber and got luckstone.

I ended up making some foolish wishes at the Castle:
2 scrolls of recharging(got 1)
Amulet of Reflection(instead of shield of Reflection)
Boots of Speed
Cloak of Protection
2 blessed scrolls of genocide(L and h)

Got another with wish in Hell.  Use for another magic marker and wrote
two recharging for my two markers, then enchant armor like crazy.

Made a big mistake and lost 10+ protection from saccing a soldier.
Raided fort Ludios to rebuy protection only to loose it again by
saccing a werejackal.
Rebought again by looting every level in Hell.(left me with about 2K in
gold)
Only time I was in real danger was an accidental dip in Ludios moat.

By this time I did not want to risk any more protection incidents, so I
just finished it up.
I had no way to find the portals other than the amulet, so it took a
while on water plane.  One the way up with the amulet I ate two
stalkers, and the invisibility saved my life on the planes.
On Astral, I picked the middle first with Pestilence... chaotic.  Then
I picked right with Famine, neutral.  Finally I braved Death after a
scare or two with Pestilence, walked right past the angels and priests
and sacrificed the amulet.

